# Instalation

1. Install the zip file from github
2. Extract the zip
3. Enter the folder and go to src/com/abcstudio/ruby/
4. Make sure you have Python installed ( I recomend Python 3.12 or 3.13 bc Python 3.14 isnt stable and cant download stuff Ruby needs in order to work)
5. Open EBOOT.py
6. Instalation is simple and just follow the things the instalator says
7. Enjoy !

